[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7981.91, "timestamp": "02:13:01", "text": "太甜蜜了，我就想请你留下来。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7983.43, "timestamp": "02:13:03", "text": "我。请留下来陪我。他当时就说："}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7985.669, "timestamp": "02:13:05", "text": "“好吧，行。我留下来陪你。”和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7986.95, "timestamp": "02:13:06", "text": "然后他就说：“好吧，就一次。”进而"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7988.31, "timestamp": "02:13:08", "text": "他就像是说：“我按下这个按钮之后，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7990.149, "timestamp": "02:13:10", "text": "好像是他主动施压的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7992.629, "timestamp": "02:13:12", "text": "在我的 OBS 上直播。” 是他。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7995.189, "timestamp": "02:13:15", "text": "是你。不是我。我当时真是太"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7998.229, "timestamp": "02:13:18", "text": "紧张的。我当时浑身发抖。还有尼克前辈"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8000.27, "timestamp": "02:13:20", "text": "就像是，“我会一直在这里，你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8003.03, "timestamp": "02:13:23", "text": "我知道了，我会按下这个按钮。我曾经"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8004.95, "timestamp": "02:13:24", "text": "按下这个按钮，一切就都属于你了。你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8006.55, "timestamp": "02:13:26", "text": "你要知道，你能行的。你知道，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8008.709, "timestamp": "02:13:28", "text": "别紧张。你一定能行。”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8012.55, "timestamp": "02:13:32", "text": "我觉得我情感上依恋你了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8014.87, "timestamp": "02:13:34", "text": "知道，就像印记一样，好的，谢谢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8016.39, "timestamp": "02:13:36", "text": "非常感谢你。就像在那一刻，就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8018.39, "timestamp": "02:13:38", "text": "因为我谁也不认识，而且我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8019.99, "timestamp": "02:13:39", "text": "我之前对流媒体非常陌生，而且"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8021.43, "timestamp": "02:13:41", "text": "我想应该已经过去两年了。但"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8023.669, "timestamp": "02:13:43", "text": "我至今仍为此心存感激。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8026.109, "timestamp": "02:13:46", "text": "那一刻，因为在那一刻就像是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8028.709, "timestamp": "02:13:48", "text": "真是太让人紧张了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8031.109, "timestamp": "02:13:51", "text": "尼克前辈是我唯一拥有的人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8034.31, "timestamp": "02:13:54", "text": "我再次重申，他就是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8036.39, "timestamp": "02:13:56", "text": "一直陪伴我到最后的人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8039.83, "timestamp": "02:13:59", "text": "结尾。就像他那样，你知道的"}]